# src/packages/control-ui/src/features/connections

## Purpose
Owns Control UI behavior for observing and mutating active connection/flow state.

## Contents
Contains connection models, hooks/mutations, and feature UI logic including refresh and owner-directed flow teardown.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Uses the canonical control transport/API surface and is consumed by connection-oriented pages/components.

## Invariants
Destructive flow actions target the intended encoded flow identifier, successful mutations trigger consistent refresh, request failures remain visible to callers/UI, and stale asynchronous responses must not overwrite newer state.